# The shared wire-format conformance corpus is a separate repository, and one of the places the
# suite looks for it is inside this repository root — which is where CI checks it out, and the
# simplest place for a contributor to clone it. Ignored so that cloning it there never makes the
# tree look dirty.
/wire-format-fixtures/

# The proof leg (proofs/check.ps1) installs the pinned F* release beside the models and keeps its
# per-invocation checked-module caches (proofs/obj/cache-<pid>) and fresh extractions under obj/;
# neither is source.
proofs/.fstar/
proofs/obj/
